---
import FullNavigationLayout from "../../astro/layouts/FullNavigationLayout.astro";
---

<FullNavigationLayout>
  <main class="mr-container mr-shell__main">
    <h1>Side-top-top navigation — legacy</h1>
    <p>
      The former <code>stt-*</code> navigation component and its private overlay state machine
      are not part of the stable package entries. It has been replaced by the Application Shell,
      which uses the shared Layer subsystem for mobile drawer behavior.
    </p>
    <p>
      Migrate to <a href="../application-shell/">Application Shell</a> and
      <a href="../../usage/layer-primitives/">Drawer Layers</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</FullNavigationLayout>
